          "text": "Fortunately, there are some simple ways you can 19 this problem . One is to improve your powers of 20 . Practise studying faces in public places, making a mental note of physical 21 such as high foreheads or narrow eyebrows . You’ll be surprised what a wide 22 of shapes and sizes people’s features have. Then, when you first meet someone, remember them as &#8216;Laura with the small nose’, for example."
